OL,3,ATrump downplays AI risks after dire
OL,4,Aexpert warnings and calls to slow
OL,5,Adevelopment down
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has
OL,8,Fdownplayed risks posed by artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence following days of dire
OL,10,Fwarnings by experts.
OL,12,F"You have a lot of very negative forces
OL,13,Fthat are bringing it up that shouldn't
OL,14,Fbe bringing it up and they're bringing
OL,15,Fup things that won't happen," Trump
OL,16,Fsaid during a visit to Ireland.
OL,18,FOne of the warnings came from a former
OL,19,FAnthropic researcher who said "there is
OL,20,Fa strong chance that we could all die
OL,21,Fin the immediate future" if the current
OL,22,Fpace of development continued.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
