OL,3,ATrump downplays AI risks after dire
OL,4,Aexpert warnings and calls to slow
OL,5,Adevelopment down
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Saturday, top industry bosses agreed
OL,8,Fand called for a slow-down. Trump did
OL,9,Fnot directly address the idea, but
OL,10,Fsaid: "We're leading China on AI...
OL,11,Fand, frankly, I want to keep it that
OL,12,Fway because whoever wins AI, wins."
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
